{"ticker":{"symbol":"TXRH","name":"Texas Roadhouse, Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":183.88,"change_pct":-0.04124302622660203,"market_cap":12067194880.0,"pe":28.91195,"pb":7.5895658,"dividend_yield":0.01631498803567544,"week52_low":153.83,"week52_high":216.3,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Restaurants","country":"United States","city":"Louisville","employees":101000,"website":"https://www.texasroadhouse.com","business_summary":"Texas Roadhouse, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates casual dining restaurants in the United States and internationally. It operates through Texas Roadhouse, Bubba's 33, and Others segments. The company's restaurants offer seasoned and aged steaks, ribs, seafood, chicken, pork chops, pulled pork, and vegetable plates, as well as an assortment of hamburgers, salads, and sandwiches; and pizza, wings, and various appetizers and dinner entrées. The company also operates and franchises restaurants under the Texas Roadhouse, Bubba's 33, and Jaggers brands. Texas Roadhouse, Inc. was founded in 1993 and is based in Louisville, Kentucky.","business_summary_ko":"Texas Roadhouse, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국 및 전 세계에서 캐주얼 다이닝 레스토랑을 운영하고 있습니다. Texas Roadhouse, Bubba's 33 및 기타 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사의 레스토랑에서는 양념하고 숙성된 스테이크, 갈비, 해산물, 닭고기, 폭찹, 풀드 포크, 야채 요리뿐만 아니라 다양한 햄버거, 샐러드, 샌드위치도 제공합니다. 피자, 날개, 다양한 전채 요리 및 저녁 식사 앙트레. 이 회사는 또한 Texas Roadhouse, Bubba's 33 및 Jaggers 브랜드로 레스토랑을 운영 및 프랜차이즈하고 있습니다. Texas Roadhouse, Inc.는 1993년에 설립되었으며 켄터키주 루이빌에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":6484855940.0,"rev_lo":6457232600.0,"rev_hi":6501000000.0,"rev_g":0.103199996,"n":22,"eps":6.35647,"eps_lo":6.13,"eps_hi":6.56,"eps_g":0.042},{"period":"2027","rev":7131078230.0,"rev_lo":6887600000.0,"rev_hi":7241213000.0,"rev_g":0.099700004,"n":27,"eps":7.53098,"eps_lo":6.39503,"eps_hi":8.37,"eps_g":0.1848}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"외식","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":4014919000.0,"operating_income":3217970